  "description": "Powerful Motor: Features a 1200W motor, achieving top speeds of 30 MPH and conquering 35-degree inclines for off-road adventures.\n\nExtended Range: Equipped with a 48V 13AH battery, providing an impressive 25-mile range and a quick 4-hour charging time.\n\nRobust Capacity: Constructed with an Aerospace-Grade Aluminum frame, supporting riders up to 330 lbs on an extra-wide 19.68\" anti-slip deck.\n\nAll-Terrain Safety: Includes 11-inch tubeless off-road tires, dual disc brakes, spring suspension, and 6-LED headlights for 360-degree visibility.\n\nSmart Portability: Offers a 3-second one-step folding system for compact storage and an HD LED dashboard for real-time ride information.\n\nVersatile Modes: Provides three speed modes: Eco (15.5 MPH), Commute (21.7 MPH), and Beast (30 MPH) for varied riding experiences.",
